# Anchored to the repo root on purpose. Unanchored, and with core.ignorecase
# true as it is on macOS, this also swallowed every feature's `Resources/`
# folder — so a bundled clip could only be added with `git add -f`, which is
# how the four already in the tree got there.
/resources/
handover/

# DJ Fuku masters: ~70 MB of 11 Mbps HEVC and the two unmixed lounge stems.
# What ships is derived from them and committed —
# Deep/Deep/Features/GlobalPause/Resources/fuku_*.mp4 and
# deep-api/media/audio/global-pause-lobby.mp3 — and the exact ffmpeg
# invocations that produce each are recorded in the PR that added them, so the
# masters can stay out of a history that never forgets.
references/fuku/
references/global-pause-lobby/